    "subject": "",
    "detail": "The timber floors in the Production Workshop, Teaching Workshop, and Scenic Art Room are lifting. We have temporarily screwed some sections down as multiple people have been tripping over them. This was discussed during the initial defects walk through in relation to the ply being screwed to the concrete, so we are unsure whether this item is still on the defects register. There are also areas where the timber floor meets the concrete with level differences of up to 15mm (Pic 5 & 5.1)",
