    "roomName": "Dance Studios",
    "subject": "TV Screen",
    "detail": "In some studios (1N.233 and 1N.232) the TV screen has been placed above the benches and pigeonholes for the dancers to sit on and store items. If you sit on the bench and lean back, you headbutt the screen – which depending on the situation could hurt the person or damage the screen. This might also be the case is some of the M&V studios too (e.g. M&V 3). Acknowledging that this might really not be possible – for instance, the screen in 1N.233 would have to be shifted to a completely new location as architecturally there is no room to go higher in its current location.",
